    "body": "> Yeah, there's a difference between not being able to show and hiding no-opping. This was discussed in one of the many issues.\r\n\r\nPresumably you mean https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9142#issuecomment-1538596372 and previous comments.\r\n\r\nI lack the experience of what web-developers actually prefer. As there are arguments for both behaviors, throwing and not throwing, let's leave the API in the current state.",
